session:pr703Summary a agp:TranscriptSummary ;
    agp:summaryText "Issue #502 was the last remaining deferred production from the original #157 umbrella (DisjointUnionOf:, HasKey:, SubPropertyChain:, and compound data ranges had all already landed via #516/#499/#500/#501). Datatype: declares a new datatype, optionally via EquivalentTo: to an existing data range -- owl_ontology already had Axiom::AxiomDatatypeDefinition and Entity::DatatypeDeclaration from owl_functional_parser's earlier landing, so no new types were needed; this PR is purely the Manchester concrete-syntax front end for constructs the type system already represented. The EquivalentTo: clause reused #501's data_range/data_primary parsing and fmt_data_range serialization directly rather than re-deriving data-range grammar handling, and the optional-annotations-plus-single-value shape followed #499's HasKey: precedent (opt_annotations, not the annotated_list helper used for genuinely list-valued sections). Two unconditional log_skip paths in the serializer (for Entity::DatatypeDeclaration and AxiomDatatypeDefinition) were replaced with real emission, closing the last silent-drop gap this crate's serializer had for round-tripping ontologies that declare custom datatypes." ;
    agp:reasoningFor ghpull:703 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy session:pr703 ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo session:claudeSonnet5 .
